Requirement Analysis

PocketSmart AI requires the following:

Functional Requirements
Enter monthly income.
Add and categorize expenses.
Calculate total expenses and remaining balance.
Set monthly budgets and savings goals.
Analyze spending patterns.
Generate AI-based budget recommendations.
Display reports and alerts.
Non-Functional Requirements
Simple and user-friendly interface.
Fast and accurate calculations.
Secure and private financial data.
Reliable and easy-to-maintain system.
Technology Requirements
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
AI: Generative AI/LLM
Database: For storing expenses and budgets
Tools: Visual Studio Code and web browser
